title: <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> unbanned
subtitle: The judges have re-legalized the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>.
view-if: warden_banned == 1 and warden_ban_timer == 1 and president == "DuFour" and chancellor == "Askew"
on-arrival: warden_banned = 0; warden_strength += 100; warden_militancy += 0.01; interior_goal_heartland += 1 if interior_goal_seen_heartland; coup_progress += 2 if warden_coup_progress >= 6; dufour_angry_bruning += 5
tags: event

President DuFour has ordered Askew and his interior minister to lift the ban on the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>.
